---
import CinematicLayout from '../layouts/CinematicLayout.astro';
import { icon } from '../lib/icons';
---
<CinematicLayout
  title="parcyun studio · 강의 자료 허브"
  description="초등교사 parcyun이 운영하는 교육·AI·디자인 강의 자료 허브. Designed by parcyun studio."
  ogTitle="parcyun studio"
  ogDescription="초등교사 · 프롬프트 엔지니어 · 디자이너. 교육과 AI를 잇는 강의 자료 허브."
  ogUrl="https://parcyun.github.io/"
>
<!-- ===== HERO ===== -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-eyebrow">Educator · Prompt Engineer · Designer</div>
    <h1 class="hero-wordmark">parcyun studio</h1>
    <p class="hero-name">parcyun · 박창현</p>
    <p class="hero-tagline">
      교육과 <strong>AI</strong>를 잇습니다.<br>
    </p>
    <div class="hero-ctas">
      <a href="/academica/" class="btn primary">강의 자료 <span class="arrow">↗</span></a>
      <a href="/atlas-gears/" class="btn primary">교육 활동 자료 <span class="arrow">↗</span></a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-ctas">
      <a href="./works/" class="btn ghost">parcyun studio works <span class="arrow">↗</span></a>
      <a href="https://www.instagram.com/parcyun" class="btn ghost" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@parcyun <span class="arrow">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== ABOUT / MANIFESTO ===== -->
<section class="about">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="section-header">
      <h2 class="ko">parcyun studio는</h2>
      <span class="en">About</span>
    </header>
    <p class="manifesto">
      디자인 · 건축 · AI를 일상 교실에 활용하고,<br>
      그 과정을 <span class="highlight">강의 자료</span>와 <span class="highlight">레퍼런스</span>로 정리해 공유합니다.
    </p>
    <div class="identity-tags">
      <span class="tag-pill">초등 교사</span>
      <span class="tag-pill">Prompt Engineer</span>
      <span class="tag-pill">Google Educator L2</span>
      <span class="tag-pill">디지털 미디어 교육</span>
      <span class="tag-pill">AI R&amp;D</span>
      <span class="tag-pill">UIUX · WEB 디자인</span>
      <span class="tag-pill">도시공학</span>
    </div>
    <button class="career-toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="career-list" onclick="toggleCareer(this)">
      <span class="label">경력 전체 보기</span>
      <span class="chev">⌄</span>
    </button>
    <div class="career-list collapsed" id="career-list">

      <div class="career-category-header">주요 경력</div>
      <div class="career-item">
        <span class="career-year">현재</span>
        <span class="career-role">몽당분필 대외협력부장 · AI R&amp;D 팀 리더</span>
        <span class="career-org">(사)디미교연</span>
      </div>

      <div class="career-category-header">강의 · 연수</div>
      <div class="career-item">
        <span class="career-year">현재</span>
        <span class="career-role">찾아가는 학교 컨설팅 주강사</span>
        <span class="career-org"></span>
      </div>
      <div class="career-item">
        <span class="career-year">—</span>
        <span class="career-role">관리자 연수 우수 사례 발표 (찾아가는 학교 컨설팅)</span>
        <span class="career-org"></span>
      </div>
      <div class="career-item">
        <span class="career-year">—</span>
        <span class="career-role">AI · 에듀테크 직무 연수 강사</span>
        <span class="career-org"></span>
      </div>
      <div class="career-item">
        <span class="career-year">—</span>
        <span class="career-role">(사)디미교연 AI · 에듀테크 내부 역량 강화 연수 강사</span>
        <span class="career-org"></span>
      </div>
      <div class="career-item">
        <span class="career-year">—</span>
        <span class="career-role">특성화고등학교 시각디자인과 생성형 AI 활용 특강</span>
        <span class="career-org"></span>
      </div>

      <div class="career-category-header">제작 · 콘텐츠</div>
      <div class="career-item">
        <span class="career-year">—</span>
        <span class="career-role">티처빌 온라인 직무연수 제작 (이미지 · 영상 생성 AI)</span>
        <span class="career-org">티처빌</span>
      </div>
      <div class="career-item">
        <span class="career-year">—</span>
        <span class="career-role">경기도교육청 미디어 리터러시 교육 영상 제작</span>
        <span class="career-org">경기도교육청</span>
      </div>

      <div class="career-category-header">위원 · 연구</div>
      <div class="career-item">
        <span class="career-year">2026</span>
        <span class="career-role">경기도교육청 AI 교육연구회 회장</span>
        <span class="career-org">경기도교육청</span>
      </div>
      <div class="career-item">
        <span class="career-year">2025</span>
        <span class="career-role">화성오산교육지원청 디지털토핑교육연구위원</span>
        <span class="career-org">화성오산교육지원청</span>
      </div>
      <div class="career-item">
        <span class="career-year">2025</span>
        <span class="career-role">경기도교육청 디지털시민역량교육연구위원</span>
        <span class="career-org">경기도교육청</span>
      </div>
      <div class="career-item">
        <span class="career-year">2023—</span>
        <span class="career-role">교실혁명 선도교사</span>
        <span class="career-org">교육부</span>
      </div>

      <div class="career-category-header">학력 · 자격</div>
      <div class="career-item">
        <span class="career-year">2023</span>
        <span class="career-role">프롬프트 엔지니어 자격</span>
        <span class="career-org">뤼튼</span>
      </div>
      <div class="career-item">
        <span class="career-year">2022</span>
        <span class="career-role">Google Certified Educator Level 2</span>
        <span class="career-org">Google</span>
      </div>
      <div class="career-item">
        <span class="career-year">2017</span>
        <span class="career-role">광주교육대학교 졸업</span>
        <span class="career-org">광주교육대학교</span>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== COLLECTIONS (자료실) ===== -->
<section id="collections">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="section-header">
      <h2 class="ko">자료실</h2>
      <span class="en">Collections</span>
    </header>
    <div class="collections-grid">
      <a href="/academica/" class="collection-card">
        <span class="cc-brand">ACADEMICA</span>
        <span class="cc-ko">강의 자료</span>
        <span class="cc-desc">교육 · AI · 디자인 강의 자료를 카테고리별로 모아뒀어요.</span>
        <span class="cc-go">서가 열기 <span class="ico" set:html={icon('arrowRight', 15)}></span></span>
      </a>
      <a href="/atlas-gears/" class="collection-card">
        <span class="cc-brand">ATLAS GEARS</span>
        <span class="cc-ko">교육 활동 자료</span>
        <span class="cc-desc">게임 · 활동지 · 커리큘럼 · 인터랙티브를 검색해서 바로.</span>
        <span class="cc-go">자료 찾기 <span class="ico" set:html={icon('arrowRight', 15)}></span></span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style is:global>
  .collections-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:18px;margin-top:6px}
  @media(min-width:720px){.collections-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
  .collection-card{position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;padding:30px 28px;border-radius:10px;
    background:var(--ps-surface-cinematic-1);border:1px solid var(--ps-surface-cinematic-3);
    transition:transform .2s var(--ps-ease-out),border-color .2s var(--ps-ease-out)}
  .collection-card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);border-color:var(--ps-primary)}
  .cc-brand{font-family:var(--ps-font-en);font-weight:800;font-size:26px;letter-spacing:-.01em;color:#fff}
  .collection-card:hover .cc-brand{color:var(--ps-primary)}
  .ico{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;line-height:0}
  .ico svg{display:block}
  .cc-ko{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ps-primary);margin-top:2px}
  .cc-desc{font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--ps-text-cinematic-secondary);margin-top:8px}
  .cc-go{margin-top:16px;font-family:var(--ps-font-en);font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.02em;color:#fff;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}
  .collection-card:hover .cc-go{color:var(--ps-primary)}
</style>

<style is:global>
/* ===== Hero ===== */
.hero {
  min-height: 100vh;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 120px 24px 80px;
  position: relative;
}
@media (min-width: 768px) {
  .hero { padding: 120px 48px 80px; }
}
.hero-inner {
  max-width: 1108px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  width: 100%;
}
.hero-eyebrow {
  font-family: var(--ps-font-en);
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 400;
  letter-spacing: 2.5px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--ps-primary);
  margin-bottom: 32px;
}
.hero-wordmark {
  font-family: var(--ps-font-signature);
  font-size: clamp(72px, 14vw, 180px);
  font-weight: 400;
  letter-spacing: -2px;
  line-height: 1.15;
  margin: 0 0 24px;
  color: var(--ps-primary);
}
.hero-name {
  font-family: var(--ps-font-en);
  font-size: clamp(13px, 1.3vw, 16px);
  font-weight: 300;
  letter-spacing: 4px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--ps-text-cinematic-secondary);
  margin: 0 0 48px;
}
.hero-tagline {
  font-size: clamp(20px, 2.5vw, 32px);
  font-weight: 300;
  letter-spacing: -0.8px;
  line-height: 1.4;
  max-width: 720px;
  margin: 0 0 48px;
  color: #FFFFFF;
}
.hero-tagline strong {
  font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--ps-primary);
}
.hero-ctas {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 12px;
}
.btn {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  padding: 14px 24px;
  font-family: var(--ps-font-en);
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 500;
  letter-spacing: 0.3px;
  border-radius: 100px;
  transition: all 240ms var(--ps-ease-out);
  cursor: pointer;
  border: 1px solid transparent;
}
.btn.primary {
  background: var(--ps-primary);
  color: #000;
}
.btn.primary:hover {
  background: var(--ps-primary-dark);
  transform: translateY(-2px);
}
.btn.ghost {
  background: transparent;
  border-color: var(--ps-surface-cinematic-3);
  color: #FFFFFF;
}
.btn.ghost:hover {
  border-color: var(--ps-primary);
  color: var(--ps-primary);
}
.btn .arrow {
  font-size: 16px;
  line-height: 1;
}

/* ===== About / Manifesto ===== */
.about {
  border-top: 1px solid var(--ps-surface-cinematic-3);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ps-surface-cinematic-3);
}
.manifesto {
  font-size: clamp(22px, 2.5vw, 32px);
  font-weight: 300;
  letter-spacing: -0.6px;
  line-height: 1.5;
  max-width: 840px;
  margin: 0;
  color: #FFFFFF;
}
.manifesto .highlight {
  color: var(--ps-primary);
  font-weight: 500;
}
.identity-tags {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 8px;
  margin-top: 48px;
}
.tag-pill {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  font-family: var(--ps-font-en);
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 400;
  color: #FFFFFF;
  background: transparent;
  border: 1px solid var(--ps-surface-cinematic-3);
  border-radius: 100px;
  padding: 5px 12px 6px;
  letter-spacing: 1px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

/* ===== Lectures grid ===== */
.lecture-section {
  margin-bottom: 80px;
}
.lecture-section:last-child {
  margin-bottom: 0;
}
.lecture-subsection-header {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 4px;
  margin-bottom: 28px;
  padding-bottom: 16px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ps-surface-cinematic-3);
}
@media (min-width: 640px) {
  .lecture-subsection-header {
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 14px;
  }
}
.lecture-subsection-header .ko {
  font-size: clamp(20px, 2vw, 24px);
  font-weight: 400;
  letter-spacing: -0.5px;
  line-height: 1.3;
  margin: 0;
  color: #FFFFFF;
}
.lecture-subsection-header .en {
  font-family: var(--ps-font-en);
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 400;
  letter-spacing: 1.8px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--ps-text-cinematic-secondary);
}

.lecture-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  gap: 24px;
}
@media (min-width: 768px) {
  .lecture-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 32px; }
}
@media (min-width: 1024px) {
  .lecture-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
}

.lecture-card {
  display: block;
  text-decoration: none;
  color: #FFFFFF;
  border: 1px solid var(--ps-surface-cinematic-3);
  border-radius: 16px;
  overflow: hidden;
  transition: border-color 320ms var(--ps-ease-out), transform 320ms var(--ps-ease-out);
}
.lecture-card:hover {
  border-color: var(--ps-primary);
  transform: translateY(-4px);
}
.lecture-card-poster {
  aspect-ratio: 370 / 220;
  background: var(--ps-surface-cinematic-1);
  position: relative;
  padding: 24px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: space-between;
  overflow: hidden;
}
/* Typographic poster (no external image needed) */
.lecture-card-poster::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  background:
    radial-gradient(at 80% 20%, rgba(255, 177, 26, 0.08) 0%, transparent 50%),
    radial-gradient(at 20% 80%, rgba(255, 177, 26, 0.04) 0%, transparent 50%);
  pointer-events: none;
}
.lecture-card-poster .lid {
  position: relative;
  font-family: var(--ps-font-en);
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 500;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--ps-primary);
}
.lecture-card-poster .ptitle {
  position: relative;
  font-size: clamp(18px, 1.8vw, 22px);
  font-weight: 300;
  letter-spacing: -0.6px;
  line-height: 1.25;
  color: #FFFFFF;
  margin: 0;
}
.lecture-card-poster .ptitle strong {
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--ps-primary);
}
.lecture-card-body {
  padding: 20px 24px 24px;
  background: var(--ps-bg-cinematic);
}
.lecture-card-meta {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  font-family: var(--ps-font-en);
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 400;
  letter-spacing: 1px;
  color: var(--ps-text-cinematic-secondary);
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}
.lecture-card-meta .dot {
  width: 4px; height: 4px;
  background: var(--ps-text-cinematic-secondary);
  border-radius: 50%;
}
.lecture-card-title {
  font-size: 17px;
  font-weight: 500;
  letter-spacing: -0.4px;
  margin: 0 0 12px;
  color: #FFFFFF;
  line-height: 1.4;
}
.lecture-card-desc {
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 300;
  line-height: 1.6;
  color: var(--ps-text-cinematic-secondary);
  margin: 0 0 16px;
}
.lecture-card-tags {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 6px;
}

/* Coming soon placeholder card */
.lecture-card.placeholder {
  border-style: dashed;
  border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  min-height: 280px;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 32px 24px;
  gap: 12px;
}
.lecture-card.placeholder:hover {
  transform: none;
  border-color: var(--ps-text-cinematic-secondary);
  cursor: default;
}
.lecture-card.placeholder .topic {
  font-size: 16px;
  font-weight: 400;
  letter-spacing: -0.3px;
  color: #FFFFFF;
  margin: 0;
  line-height: 1.4;
  word-break: keep-all;
}
.lecture-card.placeholder .cs-label {
  font-family: var(--ps-font-en);
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 500;
  letter-spacing: 2.5px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--ps-text-cinematic-secondary);
}

/* ===== Career / Timeline ===== */
.career-list {
  margin-top: 48px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--ps-surface-cinematic-3);
  padding-top: 8px;
}
.career-item {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 72px 1fr auto;
  align-items: baseline;
  gap: 0 24px;
  padding: 18px 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
}
.career-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.career-category-header {
  font-family: var(--ps-font-en);
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 500;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--ps-text-cinematic-secondary);
  padding: 28px 0 10px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ps-surface-cinematic-3);
}
.career-category-header:first-child { padding-top: 8px; }
.career-year {
  font-family: var(--ps-font-en);
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 400;
  letter-spacing: 1px;
  color: var(--ps-primary);
}
.career-role {
  font-size: 15px;
  font-weight: 400;
  letter-spacing: -0.3px;
  color: #FFFFFF;
}
.career-org {
  font-family: var(--ps-font-en);
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 300;
  letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  color: var(--ps-text-cinematic-secondary);
  text-align: right;
}
@media (max-width: 639px) {
  .career-item { grid-template-columns: 64px 1fr; grid-template-rows: auto auto; }
  .career-org { grid-column: 2; text-align: left; padding-top: 2px; }
}

/* ===== Hero CTAs (multi-row) ===== */
.hero-ctas + .hero-ctas { margin-top: 12px; }

/* ===== Arcade CTA (below activities) ===== */
.arcade-cta {
  margin-top: 56px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 24px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  padding: 28px 32px;
  border: 1px solid var(--ps-surface-cinematic-3);
  border-radius: 16px;
  background:
    repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0 6px, rgba(255,177,26,.03) 6px 7px),
    var(--ps-surface-cinematic-1);
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
  transition: border-color 320ms var(--ps-ease-out), transform 320ms var(--ps-ease-out);
}
.arcade-cta::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; height: 3px; width: 100%;
  background: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, var(--ps-primary) 0 12px, transparent 12px 20px);
  opacity: .5;
}
.arcade-cta:hover { border-color: var(--ps-primary); transform: translateY(-3px); }
.arcade-cta-inner { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
.arcade-cta-eyebrow {
  font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', var(--ps-font-en), monospace;
  font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px;
  color: var(--ps-primary);
  animation: arcadeBlink 1.6s steps(1) infinite;
}
@keyframes arcadeBlink { 0%,60%{opacity:1} 61%,100%{opacity:.35} }
.arcade-cta-title {
  font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', var(--ps-font-en), monospace;
  font-size: clamp(22px, 3vw, 30px); font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -0.5px; color: #FFFFFF;
}
.arcade-cta-title strong { color: var(--ps-primary); font-weight: 700; }
.arcade-cta-desc { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 300; color: var(--ps-text-cinematic-secondary); max-width: 520px; }
